BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Board Games & Puzzles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T163000
UID:69e7a8eb24bd39b0b5e80ebe@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Thursday after school​ to play some board gam
 es or complete puzzles! We have a variety of board games such as Connect F
 our\, Perfection\, Boggle\, Jenga\, Monopoly\, Candyland and Chess. Play a
  quick game while browsing for books.\nFor school-aged children and their 
 caregivers. All materials provided. Drop-in and self-serve.\nUnfortunately
 \, we cannot accommodate any large groups/daycares for this program.\nIf y
 ou identify as a person with a disability and require an accessibility acc
 ommodation to participate in this program\, please contact Accessibility S
 ervices by email\, accessibleservices@tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099
 \, to make a request. Please contact us at least three weeks in advance.
LOCATION:Jones\, Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e7a8eb24bd39b0b5e80ebe
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
