DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T150000
UID:69e120048ddc1caf5f1d5b6b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Find your "inner magic" during this upbeat\, hilarious\, and i
 nteractive magical experience with BenTastic! Expect a healthy dose of par
 ticipation and self-empowerment as he leads aspiring magicians of all ages
  on a journey to become "real magicians" during this fast-paced\, fun and 
 amazing magic show!\nPlease note that this program is for children aged 12
  and under. Children registered outside of this age range will not be able
  to participate.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information
  on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public 
 Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will o
 nly be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. 
 Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed t
 o Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Stre
 et\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e120048ddc1caf5f1d5b6b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
