DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where we r
 ead stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Join Megan Snider\, 
 author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspiring st
 ories and gets the whole family moving. Class begins and ends with song an
 d breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kids and
  families can sit quietly and listen\, do partial poses or make up their o
 wn\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga! No experience\, mats\, or material
 s required.\nFor children ages 0-6 years with their parents/caregivers . D
 rop-in. Space is limited.
