BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rainbow Storytime - A Celebration of Pride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260610T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260610T110000
UID:69f11c68213814b1b5255bf3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Rainbow Storytime where we celebrate all
  children and families! This Storytime will include a range of inclusive b
 ooks\, stories\, songs and rhymes that foster acceptance\, embrace diversi
 ty\, and help get kids ready for reading! This program is suitable for chi
 ldren 5 years and under with a parent or caregiver.\nDrop in. No registrat
 ion required.
LOCATION:College/Shaw\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f11c68213814b1b5255bf3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fay and Fluffy's Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T113000
UID:69f2043e2866a5b4884b8e6b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Fay & Fluffy (stars of Family Jr's The Fabulous Show with
  Fay & Fluffy) as they share some of their favourite books and stories. Fa
 y & Fluffy's main goal is to share the message of inclusivity wherever the
 y go\, cheering on all the kids who see them to be proud of who they are\,
  loving themselves and being kind to one another.\nFor children ages 5 and
  under\, accompanied by parents or caregivers.\nDrop-in. No registration r
 equired\, but space is limited.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 401
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f2043e2866a5b4884b8e6b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
